<blockquote class="uncited"><div>Would it be easy to integrate several calibration points for the S-meter in the calibration menu?</div></blockquote>No.<br><br>S meter reading is only an approximate value because the hardware in the radio is not very accurate at measuring signal level.<br><br>It would not be practical to add S meter calibration paramaters to the calibration<br><br>Also, the number of people who would have the test equipment which would be requried to calibrate the signal level is very few, so this would be a feature that virtually no one would use<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Mon Aug 05, 2024 12:16 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
